Package: quickvis
Title: Visualization Tools for Factor Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Parker", "McKasson", , "parkermckasson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates shaded loading tables for exploratory factor analysis
    and compares multiple solutions on a shared color scale. Draws path
    diagrams for confirmatory factor analysis models fitted with 'lavaan',
    including cross-loadings, bifactor layouts, and tracing of contributions
    to fitted variances and covariances.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    gt,
    scales,
    stats,
    tidyselect
Suggests:
